AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; Yeah, this is a startup with technical founders. So, the go-to-market side, the sales side is newer for them, and that\'s where having an agent like this that can come out of the box with some pre-built skills about how to run this function'

[04:50] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'even just at the most basic level, but then do things that, you know, would not even be practical even if you started to hire a sales team, but without an agent like this, like you would not never put your junior BDR on the task of like'

[05:02] [scene:talk]
